## wandb key
You need a secrets.mk containing
'''
WANDB_API_KEY = your_wandb_key
'''
do NOT commit this file to github

## sky configuration file
Your need to create a .sky/config.yaml file at root containing this
'''
aws:
 labels:
  Platform: craft-llm
  Product: llm
'''

for Francois, so he can track expenses.

## s3 buckets
You will probably want to make your own s3 buckets, in which case you can make them on the page, don't forget to change the mounts in the remote/remote_train.py file.

## environment
Install all the packages from requirements.txt
'''
pip install -r requirements.txt
'''

## installing sky
On your local environment you also need to install sky (follow the sky quickstart guide)
and configure aws with your key

## downloading stockfish
If you want to test the model against stockfish for some kind of elo evaluation, you will need stockfish installed. Go to the [stockfish download page](https://stockfishchess.org/download/) and download the version corresponding to your computer.
Then, link to the file location in the makefile under elo_evaluation_gm